# alpha-metrics.ai

> Market research practice in Vienna, Austria. Brand tracking, consumer surveys,
> questionnaire programming, driver analysis and dashboards for brands in Austria,
> Germany and Switzerland (DACH). Every estimate is reported with its 95% confidence
> interval and base; countries are compared, not pooled; associations are not reported
> as effects.

Languages: German, English. Contact: info@alpha-metrics.ai

## Services
- [Brand tracking and funnel studies](https://alpha-metrics.ai/de/leistungen/brand-tracking/): awareness, consideration and purchase for a brand and its competitors, baseline or repeated waves
- [Questionnaire design and programming](https://alpha-metrics.ai/de/leistungen/fragebogen-programmierung/)
- [Analysis and driver models](https://alpha-metrics.ai/de/leistungen/treiberanalyse/)
- [Dashboards and reporting](https://alpha-metrics.ai/de/leistungen/dashboards/)

## Method
- [Six standards](https://alpha-metrics.ai/#standards): interval on every estimate, minimum base of 30 for brand results, reported quality exclusions, design effect stated for weighted results, countries compared not pooled, association is not effect
- [Showcase case study](https://alpha-metrics.ai/#showcase): two-country brand study of ZINTO, a fictional brand with synthetic data

